		(property "Description" "Pogo pin KERUI KTT50003UT01-R (LCSC C56282211), through hole: 5.00 mm free, 3.70 mm normal (50 g +-20 g) and 3.80 mm max working height, 3.50 mm fully in; 2.0 mm flange, 1.5 mm barrel, 0.9 mm plunger; 0.7 x 1.0 mm tail in a 0.9 mm plated hole. The flange sits on the pad and is soldered on that side; the tail side stays under solder mask, so no solder comes out there and a part can sit flat over the pin. The pad is 2.2 x 2.8 mm, long in y: with pins 2.54 mm apart in x, a round one could be only 0.1 mm wider than the flange, and the length gives the iron and the fillet room"
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "B.Fab")
